'''Fishing Net''' (Japanese: '''おさかなネット''' ''Fish Net'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=Put a random Basic {{e|Water}} Pokémon from your discard pile into your hand.
}}

==Trivia==
* {{TCGP|Celestic Town Elder}} has a similar effect, but is a {{TCGP|Supporter card}} instead of an {{TCGP|Item card}} and is not restricted to only {{e|Water}} Pokémon.
* This card's effect is similar to {{TCG|Pokémon Rescue}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but this card can only add a Basic {{e|Water}} Pokémon chosen at random (rather than a specifically chosen Pokémon of any Evolution stage and type).

